# Game Assets & Large Binary Formats (Saves ~4.1 GB)
# =========================================================================
# Textures & Images
*.dds
*.tga
*.bmp
*.jpg
*.image
*.ico
*.cur

# 3D Models, Animations & Character Assets
*.o3d
*.ani
*.ase
*.chr

# Audio & Music
*.wav
*.ogg
*.bgm
*.sfx

# Proprietary Game/Engine Data & Map Files
*.lnd
*.rgn
*.dyo
*.wld

# Backup files
*.old

# Weird files generated by VS?
*.json
*.command

# Error/log files
